data: {"id": "5bd501b8fcb0433a-thinking-parallel_evidence-1071", "run_id": "5bd501b8fcb0433a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n### 已确认事实\n\n**1. Pod 当前状态**\n- **Phase: Pending**, 容器状态: **Waiting / ImagePullBackOff**，未恢复。\n\n**2. PromQL 指标基线**\n- `kube_pod_status_phase=Pending=1`（Pending 持续存在）\n- `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=ImagePullBackOff=1`（等待原因明确）\n- `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total=0`（无重启记录）\n- 无 `last_terminated_reason` 数据（容器从未启动过）\n\n**3. Kubernetes Events（来自 kubectl_describe）**\n- 核心错误：`Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"`\n- **根因事件原文**：`dial tcp: lookup registry.inva", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789042710054, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

