data: {"id": "5bd501b8fcb0433a-final", "run_id": "5bd501b8fcb0433a", "seq": 1076, "ts_ms": 1789042726355, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp 持续处于 Pending 和 ImagePullBackOff 状态，无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Warning Failed... Error: ErrImagePull` 及 `Warning Failed... Error: ImagePullBackOff` | 确认 Pod 长期处于拉取镜像失败的异常状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet | `BackOff... Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` | 记录重试背退行为及具体的失败镜像路径 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Failed to pull image... rpc error... dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | 提供决定性的根因：DNS 解析域名 `registry.invalid` 失败 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (container=\"app\", reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\") = 1 | 指标层面印证镜像拉取阻塞是容器当前等待的唯一原因 |\n| 5 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.status: Pending` | 确认 Pod 尚未启动，无容器运行数据 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 0 | 确认 Pod 尚未进入重启循环，故障处于初始化阶段 |\n\n**证据分析**：K8s 事件（#3）中的 `lookup registry.invalid ... no such host` 直接指明了网络/配置层面的阻断点。Metric 数据（#4, #6）与 K8s 状态（#5, #1）相互印证，排除了资源不足或应用崩溃导致的重启问题，确认故障完全停留在镜像拉取阶段。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nDeployment 配置了无效域名 registry.invalid → DNS 解析失败 (no such host) → 镜像拉取请求被阻断 (ErrImagePull) → Pod 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：容器镜像仓库地址配置错误。\n\nPod `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp` 无法启动的原因是 kubelet 尝试拉取镜像 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing` 时，DNS 无法解析域名 `registry.invalid`（见证据 #3）。这导致镜像拉取流程在连接建立前即告失败，进而引发 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态。现有 K8s 事件与 Metric 事实形成了完整的证据链，足以确认该配置错误为直接根因。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 57.9s\n├─ 问题定位: 17.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 31.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp: 31.5s (Evidence 23.9s, RCA 7.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 57.922, "metrics": {"run_id": "5bd501b8fcb0433a", "mttr": {"value": "57.9s", "seconds": 57.92468810081482, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 57924.68810081482, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 54791.807651519775, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 8, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 6356.55665397644, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2800.7137775421143}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17717.81587600708, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 31529.46376800537, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 8656.665086746216, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

